ad up the trap into the  upstairs chamber and before you head  into the basement with the crabs and  levered to the normal boss there's  actually an illusory wall on the top  floor which will lead you to a black  knife assassin boss the assassin will  drop an assassin cerulean dagger which  is nice for some lore as well as the  fact that it allows critical hits to  restore your fp  but the real interesting find here is  the black knife print not only does it  have interesting lore tied to it but  it's also a quest item related to one of  the endings you can get when you finish  the game farming the big boy dragon  there's an easy way to get some fast  runes early in the game i'm talking  about big boy grail or at least that's  what i believe this dragon's name is in  grails dragon barrow you know given the  name of the area grail's dragon barrow  is pretty much as far east as you can  head on the map within caled it's  located right here on the map you have a  couple of options with grail if you want  you can find a spot where his guardian  baby dragons he spawns won't notice you  and you can take him out quietly getting  75 000 runes meanwhile if you use a gold  pickled foul foot it'll actually boost  how many runes you can get while it's  active meaning grail will instead give  you around 97 000 runes  you can also equip the gold scarab  talisman which has a similar effect to  the gold pickled foul foot to be honest  i don't know if these effects stack or  not but it's worth a shot this is  definitely a nice option if you're  struggling and want to get some quick  levels right off the bat however there  is another way to farm grail you see he  spawns guardian baby dragons constantly  while he's alive and one way to kill him  and the way i originally did is by  taking out these dragons with each kill  taking out a chunk of his life each of  these baby dragons you kill will give  you  5423 runes and while they hit hard once  you learn their pattern they really  aren't that difficult to kill and it  will simultaneously train you how to  kill just about every other dragon in  the game not only that but by resting  out a sight of grace with one right  nearby you're on a map if you're  wondering they respond and so does  grail's health that means that once you  get good at learning their pattern each  one is a nice and fairly quick way to  gain  5423 runes it is more time consuming  than methodically whittling away at him  which by the way using bleed will help  with but if you're really hurting for  runes it is worth thinking about  torrent back fighting i've talked about  illusory walls in rune farming so let's  go back to the basics i'm talking about  basic gameplay after playing years worth  of from software games i've gotten used  to the idea that your right trigger  buttons are related to your right-handed  weapons and your left trigger buttons  are related to your left-handed weapons  so when i finally got on torrent i  didn't even think to hit l1 or l2 as i  was trying to use my weapon  in fact i'm such a [ __ ] that i  practically played the entire game this  way so learn from me and my mistakes  while you're on torrent your left  trigger button acts as a way to swing to  the left of your horse that's right you  can do both light and strong attacks to  the left side you aren't just limited to  hitting to your right  i  am a [ __ ] double attacks while on  torrent and speaking of horseback combat  did you know that r2 and l2 or your  strong attacks on the horse can actually  get you multiple hits on enemies this is  an extremely useful tool i also didn't  use until much later in the game than i  care to admit while i knew that these  were stronger attacks i didn't realize  that you can actually get a double hit  with one attack while you're dragging  your weapon along the ground any enemy  you pass by will get hit by your weapon  when you let go of the trigger you'll  perform an upward strike also hurting  the enemy so if you time it out properly  that means you can hit the same enemy  with a quick one-two combo of dragging  your weapon then an upward slice attack  oh and while i'm at it with this when  you see mobs of enemies along the ground  why not run past them on torrent while  dragging your blade as you'll be able to  easily damage a giant group in one fell  swoop if you aim correctly as the drag  attack can hit any enemy that touches it  as you run by  spirit springs more like spirit wells  while i'm on this torn roll let's talk  about spirit springs  these are the gusts of air you'll see  all over the lands between that you can  use to launch torn high up in the air  and reach new locations or at the very  least climb up cliffs much quicker and  more conveniently than you'd otherwise  have to  but did you know that you can actually  jump right back down those spirit  springs and you'll survive the fall  meaning you can actually use them as a  convenient and quick way to travel down  cliffs that would otherwise kill you  from the drop and not just use them to  travel up the more you know  torrents and status effects i'm going to  continue with even more info on torrent  because torrent is a king and kings  deserve to be loved especially if  they're the elden lord and they're me  mainly i'm just talking about me  one of the many amazing things about  torrent is that riding him will help you  avoid picking up status effects from any  poison rot or other ground ailments feel  free to run over rivers of rot and  poison while on torrent without a worry  in the world except for being knocked  off of him also be careful as status  effects in the air can still hit and  affect you of course you can't use  torrent and dungeons so this won't work  for every situation but it is nice to  know and speaking of situations where  you're torrentless do not roll in poison  hiratake miyazaki loves poison so much  so i wouldn't be surprised if his home  was built in a poison swamp surrounded  by 