 to holy damage when it's  equipped  nice  those statues with glints in them have  you noticed the statues that have item  glints in them you know like the one on  stormhill near all of the trolls or  perhaps the one near the end of  stormville castle well these are good  very very good they pretty much always  contain a whole slew of smithing stones  inside and all you need to get them is a  very big enemy while it doesn't have to  be a troll for these two examples i'll  use a troll  up top on storm hill beta troll into  hitting the statue and you'll unlock all  of its goodies meanwhile in stormville  you'll have to get the troll hanging out  by godric to notice you chase you down  all the way back to the statue and then  bait him into attacking it there are  plenty more statues like these so keep  your eyes peeled for them and make sure  to bait a big enemy into breaking them  for you  that does it for this week's 10 things i  hope you learned something new if you  missed it i made an episode last week  focusing on lim grave and we'll have a  new episode on 10 more things for you  next week thanks so much for watching  and i'll see you guys soon for more  elden ring content peace
 

